  "body": "To review the changes, the PR won't show you the changes made to the adoc since they have already been merged.\r\nSo, instead, I've attached some built files that contain a nice human-readable representation of the normative rules. Just download the 3 HTML files and open norm-rules.html in your browser. Then navigate to the CMO section (use navigation bar on the left).\r\n\r\n[norm-rules.html](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23862847/norm-rules.html)\r\n[riscv-privileged.html](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23862849/riscv-privileged.html)\r\n[riscv-unprivileged.html](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23862851/riscv-unprivileged.html)\r\n",
